@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title 11. Supervisor Agent Request / Runtime State Machine

skinparam shadowing false

[*] --> REQUEST_RECEIVED
REQUEST_RECEIVED --> HITL_EVALUATING

HITL_EVALUATING --> WAITING_REVIEW : HitlPolicyResult.required=true
HITL_EVALUATING --> REQUEST_VALIDATED : HitlPolicyResult.required=false

WAITING_REVIEW --> RUNNING_APPROVED : tasks/review/decide APPROVE
WAITING_REVIEW --> CANCELED : tasks/review/decide CANCEL

RUNNING_APPROVED --> REQUEST_VALIDATED

REQUEST_VALIDATED --> HISTORY_LOADED
HISTORY_LOADED --> PLANNED
PLANNED --> ROUTING_SELECTED
ROUTING_SELECTED --> A2A_CALLING : plans exist
ROUTING_SELECTED --> COMPOSING : no plan / max iteration reached

A2A_CALLING --> HANDOFF_EVALUATING
HANDOFF_EVALUATING --> HANDOFF_APPLIED : accepted handoff exists
HANDOFF_EVALUATING --> HANDOFF_SKIPPED : none / rejected / flag disabled
HANDOFF_APPLIED --> A2A_RESULT_MERGED
HANDOFF_SKIPPED --> A2A_RESULT_MERGED
A2A_RESULT_MERGED --> ROUTING_SELECTED : next plan exists
A2A_RESULT_MERGED --> COMPOSING : all plans consumed

COMPOSING --> COMPLETED
CANCELED --> [*]
COMPLETED --> [*]

note right of WAITING_REVIEW
This is a task/review lifecycle state,
not SupervisorRuntimeState.
end note

note bottom
Planned P2 extension states
- REVISED
- WAITING_FOR_USER_INPUT
These are not implemented in current source yet.
end note

note right of REQUEST_VALIDATED
Current runtime enum sequence begins here.
SupervisorRuntimeState values:
- REQUEST_VALIDATED
- HISTORY_LOADED
- PLANNED
- ROUTING_SELECTED
- A2A_CALLING
- HANDOFF_EVALUATING
- HANDOFF_APPLIED
- HANDOFF_SKIPPED
- A2A_RESULT_MERGED
- COMPOSING
- COMPLETED
end note

note right of HANDOFF_EVALUATING
Policy checks
- feature flag
- route allowlist
- method allowlist
- stream support
- max hops / recent path / rate limit
end note
@enduml
